<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="RUT" style="id">- Toma Bible</book>
  <para style="h">Lute</para>
  <para style="toc1">Lute Ná-Sɛʋɛi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Lute</para>
  <para style="toc3">Lut</para>
  <para style="mt1">Lute</para>
  <para style="mt2">Ná-Sɛʋɛi</para>
  <para style="imt">Sɛʋɛi lɔɔzeizuʋɛ ma woo mɔungiti</para>
  <para style="ip">Lute Ná-Sɛʋɛi ɠa faa maanɛɛnɛgi tanigaa zuɠulazu, niiti ti zeelini Izilayɛle ʋɛlɛyeɠei ta ma, Izilayɛle lukpɔɠaaleʋe nuiti ta-ziɛgi zu. Pɛlɛyeɠei naa ma ʋɛlɛ deei, nii daa ga Naomi, naa ɠɛni faa ɓɔi wola laawu, siɛgi zu sinigi ta ná-doun zunu felegɔiti ti zaani la, naazu ti zeini Moaɓe wɛɛn yooi zu. Kɛlɛ naa ɠulaai ma su, Naomi tuya zɔlɔɔni siɛgi zu ná-doun anzai gilagi, nii daa ɠɛni ga Lute, Moaɓe nui, naa ʋilɛni la polu kɛai ma ɠalesu ma Izilayɛle yooi zu, ta é minazeɠe bɛ ga toɠa yeezei bu. Naa ʋoluma anzanu felegɔi niiti, Lute ta Naomi ti tuya zɔlɔɔni, siɛgi zu pɛlɛyeɠei naa ʋaalobai gila, nii daa ga Ɓoaze, naa minazeɠeni la ga toɠa ɠaaɓa ti ma, ta é Lute zeɠe ga anza. Tukpɔɠaaleʋe nuiti ta-yeeɠɛɠalai wola ɲɔuni, Izilayɛle nui ma mɔinmɔin ge ɠɛni ta-eteai ziɛzu, ti maavaa la tɔgiti ba, kɛlɛ Naomi ta Lute, naa ʋɛɛ Ɓoaze ʋa, ta-vai ɠɛni yɛ, ti ɠɛni ga Izilayɛle nuiti niiti ti ɠɛni pɔ ga ti ziɛ ga GALA ná-tɔgiti.</para>
  <para style="ip">Nu nɔpɛ ge la sɛʋɛi nii zɛʋɛ nui ɠwɛɛ. Nu la kwɛɛ ɓalaa siɛgi nii kulaai la, kɛlɛ tanigaa ti ɠɛ sɛʋɛi nii zɛʋɛʋɛ siɛgi zu Izilayɛle nuiti ti ɠula la duɔlai zu, naa lɔɔzei Eɓulu wooi ma zii ʋa, nii sɛʋɛi ɠɛai su. Fai ta ɠa ná nii maanɛai nu ɠizɛ su, naa ɠa ga Lute nii é la ɠɛni ga Izilayɛle nu, naa ɠɛɛʋɛ ga masagi Davide dee wola ʋolu lee wolai. Naa ɠa bosu ga toɠa ɓalaa ga Yesu Kilista mɛmɛwolai ta, naa ɠa dɛɛzu ga nu ɠɛɛ vai ga GALA nɔnɔ, naa la ɠulazu nɔ ɗa-ʋɛlɛyeɠei zu, kɛlɛ nu yiimaʋɛ.</para>
  <para style="iot">Unsosuʋɛ</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Naomi ná-pɛlɛyeɠei ta faa ɓɔii nii é zeelini pɛlɛyeɠei ma, ta ʋelei Naomini ta Lute ti ɠaleni la ma Izilayɛle yooi zu. (<char style="xt"><ref loc="RUT 1:1-22">1:1-22</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">2. Luteni ta Ɓoaze ti ɠaani, siɛgi zu Lute ɠɛni molo ɠɔpɔgiti zɛʋɛzu la, niiti ti ɠɛni yɛsu molo leʋe nuiti pogi zu Ɓoaze ná-kpalagaʋɛ (<char style="xt"><ref loc="RUT 2:1-23">2:1-23</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">3. Naomi Lute leʋeni ga é li, é ɠɛ Ɓoaze ma, ti vulu ɓɔɠɔma ta naa, nii a kɛ Ɓoaze ɠaaɓa ma, tɔɔzei Ɓoaze ɠɛni ga pɛlɛyeɠei ʋaalobai ta ɓɔɠɔɓɔɠɔ minazeɠegi maaʋele ma. Ɓoaze vaani naa wu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="RUT 3:1-18">3:1-18</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="io1">4. Ɓoaze Naomi sinigi ʋoganiiti unmɔɔni, é zɛba é Lute vulu ga anza (<char style="xt"><ref loc="RUT 4:1-22">4:1-22</ref></char>).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="RUT 1"/>
  <para style="s">Elimelɛke ná-pɛlɛyeɠei <optbreak/> ná-maanɔɠɔ vai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 1:1"/>Tukpɔɠaaleʋe nuiti ta-ziɛgi zu, pului looni Izilayɛle nuiti ta-yooi zu. Ɓɛteleyɛme laai é Zuda yooi zu, naama zunui ta liini ta anzai ta ná-doun zunu felegɔiti, ga ti lago zei Moaɓe yooi zu. <verse eid="RUT 1:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 1:2"/>Zunui naa laaseigi ɠɛni ga Elimelɛke, anzai laaseigi ɠɛni ga Naomi, ta ná-doun zunu felegɔiti daaseigiti ti ɠɛni ga Maalon ta Kiliyon. Ti ɠɛni ga Efelata nuiti, Ɓɛteleyɛme laai zu Zuda yooi zu. Ti zeeliai ma Moaɓe yooi zu, ti zeizuʋɛ ɓɛtɛni ná. <verse eid="RUT 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 1:3"/>Naomi zinigi Elimelɛke zaani, anzanui ɠila ko yɛni niina ná, ta ná-doun zunu felegɔiti. <verse eid="RUT 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 1:4"/>Ti Moaɓe anzanuiti seini. Gilagi laaseigi ɠɛni ga Wɔɔlepa, felesiɛi laaseigi ɠɛ ga Lute. Ti zeini ná kona puugɔ laawu. <verse eid="RUT 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 1:5"/>Maalon ta Kiliyon ti zaani ɓalaa ti felegɔ pɛ. Naomi yɛni ná, balagai ná-doun felegɔiti ma ta sinigi.<verse eid="RUT 1:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lute ta Naomi <optbreak/> ti lii vai Ɓɛteleyɛme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 1:6"/>É yɛni Moaɓe yooi zu, é mɛni ga Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI undaanɛɛ laa ná-nuɓusɛiti bɛ, é daamianigi vea ti ya. É wuzeɠeni, tɔ-o, ná-doun anzaiti-yo, ga ti zeɠe Moaɓe yooi zu. <verse eid="RUT 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 1:7"/>Ti zeɠeni ti-zeizuʋɛ, ta ná-doun anza felegɔiti, ti ʋilɛ pelei ma, ga ti ɠale ma Zuda yooi zu. <verse eid="RUT 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 1:8"/>Naomi ɠɛni naazu ná-doun anza felegɔiti ma: «À ɠale ma, ɛsɛ ge li dee ná-pɛlɛi wu. Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI faaɓɔɠɔ ɠɛ wo ʋɛ, ʋelei wo kɛa la wo-zinigiti bɛ, niiti ti zaai, ta wo kɛa la nà ɓalaa bɛ. <verse eid="RUT 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 1:9"/>Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI wo ɠilagilagi zei ʋele ɓɛtɛ zini pɛlɛi wu, wa ɠɛ bu!» É ti nɛɛnɛni. Ti tɔɔzeini ga wɔlɔa. <verse eid="RUT 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 1:10"/>Ti ɠɛni ma: «Ɓa-o, ada liizu ʋɔɔma ɗa-nuɓusɛiti pɔ bɛ.»<verse eid="RUT 1:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 1:11"/>Naomi ɠɛni ti ma: «À ɠale ma, dòun anzanuiti! Lee vaa zu wa ʋilɛ pòlu? Doun zunua ta kòozu mɔnɔ ɓaa, ta ɠɛ ga wo-zinigiti? <verse eid="RUT 1:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 1:12"/>À ɠale ma, dòun anzanuiti. À li! Mazɔlɔɔ gòla wɔlɔʋɛ na, gè ʋa zei zini bɛ. Anɛɛ ɓalaa nà ɠɛɛzu ma: ‹Kito ka bɛ̀, ga za ɓidii, gè ve zini bɛ ga gè zunu lounɠa zɔlɔɔ,› <verse eid="RUT 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 1:13"/>wa naati maaɓɔun ga ti wɔɔlɔ, wa ɠɛlɛ wo zei vai ʋa zini bɛ naazu ɓaa? Ɓa-o, dòun anzanuiti! Mazɔlɔɔ nà-kpɔlɔi wɔɔlɔʋɛ wɔnɔi ʋa, ta mɔnɔ Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI yeewuzeɠeʋɛ dàalɔɠɔma.»<verse eid="RUT 1:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 1:14"/>Ti wɔlɔni mɔnɔ. Wɔɔlepa deemɔɔn nɛɛnɛni, ti bali ma, kɛlɛ Lute ɠilini ba. <verse eid="RUT 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 1:15"/>Naomi ɠɛni Lute ma: «Pɛtɛ, è-zeebɔi ɠalega ma ná-nuɓusɛiti pɔ ta ná-galagiti. Ɠale ma, è ʋilɛ è-zeebɔi ʋolu.»<verse eid="RUT 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 1:16"/>Kɛlɛ Lute ɠɛni ma: «Mina ɓɔi dà ga gè zeɠe è ʋolu, ga gè ɠɛlɛ è ʋa! Ʋɛ ɗa li ná, nà li miná, ʋɛ ɗa zei ná, nà zei miná. Ɗa-nuɓusɛiti ta ɠɛ ga nà-nuɓusɛiti, ɗa-ƓALAGI ɠa ɠɛ ga nà-GALAGI. <verse eid="RUT 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 1:17"/>Ʋɛ ɗa za ná, nà za miná, màaɠulu ná. Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI sò ná-ziiɠaawanai pɛ su, ni ani ɠili ka kpèteʋena è ʋa, é ɠula saai ʋolu!» <verse eid="RUT 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 1:18"/>Naomi kaai ma ga wɔinʋɛ ga ti li ʋɔɔma, é zɛni kana niina.<verse eid="RUT 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 1:19"/>Ti felegɔ ti ziɛni ʋɔɔma, eyɛsu ti zeeli Ɓɛteleyɛme. Siɛgi zu ti lɛɛni la Ɓɛteleyɛme, taai kpein ge ɓusɛni ti maaʋele ma, anzanuiti ti ɠɛni ɠɛɛzu ma: «Naomi ɠa nɛi ɓaa?» <verse eid="RUT 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 1:20"/>É ɠɛni ti ma-o: «À mina mɔ tòli ga Naomi,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Naomi</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Daaseigi nii poluʋɛ ga «koozunɛ anzanui».</char></note> kɛni Mala.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:20 </char><char style="fk" closed="false">Mala</char><char style="ft" closed="false">: Daaseigi nii poluʋɛ ga «ziiɓɔlɔ anzanui».</char></note> Mazɔlɔɔ Zɛbɛi-Pɛ-Maliɠii eteai ɓaa mà. <verse eid="RUT 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 1:21"/>Dìizuʋɛ, zèei laavega ɠɛni de, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋaa ga ze zèaɲakai. Lee vaa zu wa tòli ga Naomi? Tɔɔzei Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋoluavega bà, Zɛbɛi-Pɛ-Maliɠii màanɔɠɔa.»<verse eid="RUT 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 1:22"/>Zekana Naomi ta ná-doun anzai Lute, Moaɓe nui, ti ʋaani la, ti zeɠe Moaɓe yooi zu. Ti zeelini Ɓɛteleyɛme, moloi nii daa ga wɔɔlezegi, naa leʋe vai lɔɔzeiɗai nɔ kpein.<verse eid="RUT 1:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="RUT 2"/>
  <para style="s">Lute molo ɠɔpɔgi yɛʋɛ vai <optbreak/> Ɓoaze ná-kpalagaʋɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 2:1"/>Naomi zinigi ná-nui ta ɠɛni ná. É ɠɛni ga zobobɛ nu kpɛtɛai, Elimelɛke ná-pɛlɛyeɠei wu, daaseigi ɠɛni ga Ɓoaze. <verse eid="RUT 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 2:2"/>Moaɓe nui Lute ɠɛni Naomi ma: «Nà è maanɛɛnɛzu ga è va bu, gè li molo ɠɔpɔ gaiziɛzuʋɛ kpalagaʋɛ, naama nui ʋosuʋɛ, nii a màawɔinɠa.» É ɠɛni ma: «Li, dòun anzanu.»<verse eid="RUT 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 2:3"/>É liini molo ɠɔpɔ gaiziɛzuʋɛ kpalagi ta zu, molo leʋe nuiti pogi zu. É zolooni nɔ kpein ga kpalagi naa ɠɛni ga Ɓoaze nɔnɔi, nii é ɠɛni ga Elimelɛke ná-pɛlɛyeɠei wu nui.<verse eid="RUT 2:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 2:4"/>Ná tago kɛai ma, Ɓoaze ʋaani, é zeɠe Ɓɛteleyɛme, é ɠɛ molo leʋe nuiti ma: «Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ɠɛ wo ʋa!» Ti gooɠaaʋoteni, ti ɠɛ ma: «Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI tuya loo è ʋɛ!»<verse eid="RUT 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 2:5"/>Ɓoaze ɠɛni ná-botiɠɛ zunui ma, nii é ɠɛni wɛlɛzu molo leʋe nuiti ma: «Anzanu loungoi nii ɠa ga ɓɛ ná-doun?» <verse eid="RUT 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 2:6"/>Botiɠɛ zunui é ɠɛni wɛlɛzu molo leʋe nuiti ma, naa gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Moaɓe anzanu loungoi ta ʋe, nii ti ʋaai ta Naomi, ti zeɠe Moaɓe yooi zu. <verse eid="RUT 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 2:7"/>É bogɛ mà ga gè va bu, é ɗa molo ɠɔpɔgiti gaiziɛ, molo ɠiliiti zɔɠɔzu, molo leʋe nuiti poluʋelei, é ɗa ti ɠaalɛ ba. Paa yee ma za sobui, toɠa loni nɔ eyɛsu niizu, é lago looɠogɛ nɔ kotai wu.»<verse eid="RUT 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 2:8"/>Ɓoaze ɠɛni Lute ma: «Woilo, dòun anzanu, mina li molo ɠɔpɔ gaiziɛzu kpala kili su, mina maaɠooza ʋɛ ʋa, yɛ nà-botiɠɛ anzanuiti ba. <verse eid="RUT 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 2:9"/>Wɛlɛ ʋɛ moloi leʋezu ná kpalagi zu, è li ti ʋolu. Gè nà-botiɠɛ zunuiti tɛnɛgɛ ga ti mina vɔɔɠu è ʋa. Siɛgi zu kpɔɔle wɔin è zosu da, ɗa li ziɛ liɠiiti pɔ bɛ, è ɓɔɔle ga nii botiɠɛ zunuiti ti saɠaai.» <verse eid="RUT 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 2:10"/>É ʋilɛni ɲiibiɠa zooi ma, é nɔkɔ, é ɠɛ ma: «Gè zaalai zɔlɔɔgɛ ɠale è ɠaazu, ga è ɠɛɛzu mà bɛbɛ, nɛ̀i gè ga wɛɛn anzanui?» <verse eid="RUT 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 2:11"/>Ɓoaze gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Ti naa kpein bogɛ mà, nii è kɛa è-leemɔɔn ʋɛ, è-zinigi zaa ʋoluma, ʋelei è zeɠeai la è-ɠɛɛ ta è-leeni ba, ta zooi è zɔlɔɔgai su, ga è ʋa nuɓusɛiti pɔ, niiti è la ɠɛa ti ɠwɛɛ pɔlɔmazu. <verse eid="RUT 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 2:12"/>Nii è kɛa, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI naama ɠulanumai ve è ʋɛ. Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI, Izilayɛle ná-GALAGI, nii è ʋaa, è lɔɔɠu koʋegi wu, naa ɗa-ɠulanumai zuwɔɔlɔ gola.» <verse eid="RUT 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 2:13"/>Lute ɠɛni ma: «Ee, Màliɠii, gè zaalai zɔlɔɔga è ɠaazu! Mazɔlɔɔ è gàanɛɛnɛa, ta è ɓɔɛa pɔ̀, è zìila, nɛ̀i, gè ga ɗa-wotiɠɛ anzanui. Anɛɛ naa ʋe, nɔ̀un, gè la ga ɗa-wotiɠɛ anzanuiti gila kpalaa kɛʋele.»<verse eid="RUT 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 2:14"/>Daamii ziɛgi zu, Ɓoaze ɠɛni ma: «Maaɓuɠa, è daamii wo, ɗa-ɓulu ɓuɠai lɔ guulu daɓai wu.» É zeini molo leʋe nuiti kobaʋɛ. Ɓoaze ani ɠae ɠeegai veeni zea. É miini, é yiɠo, é mɔtai makɛ. <verse eid="RUT 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 2:15"/>Naa ʋolu é wuzeɠeni posuyɛʋɛi ma. Ɓoaze niima levei veeni ná-botiɠɛ zunuiti zea, é ɠɛ ti ma: «À yeezei bu ga é posuyɛʋɛi ɠɛ ɓalaa molo ɠiliiti zɔɠɔzu. À mina kpɔlɔ. <verse eid="RUT 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 2:16"/>Anɛɛ wa ma ɠɔpɔgi tanigaa ɠula ma ɠiliiti ba, ga wo zɛ ná, é zɛʋɛ, wo mina zelilo ma.»<verse eid="RUT 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 2:17"/>É posuyɛʋɛi ɠɛɛni kpalagaʋɛ eyɛsu kpɔkɔi. É naa loɠani, nii é zɛʋɛni. É kilo ʋuusaʋagɔ (30) ɓɔlɔ ɠila daaveni ga molo ɠaamagi nii daa ga wɔɔlezegi. <verse eid="RUT 2:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 2:18"/>Nii é zɛʋɛni, é naa zeɠeni, é lii la taazu, é dɛɛni ga deemɔɔn. É ná-daamianigi mɔtai ɓalaa ɠulani, é ti ve zea. <verse eid="RUT 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 2:19"/>Deemɔɔn ɠɛni ma: «Mini ɠa è posuyɛʋɛi ɠɛai ná za? Mini ɠa è botii ɠɛai ná za? Tuya ɠa naa ʋɛ, zɔi é è zɛsɛbogai!» É naa kpein suɠulani deemɔɔn ma, nii kpein é ziɛni su. Naa ʋolu, é ɠɛni ma: «Zunui nii gè botii ɠɛai pɔ bɛ, daa ɠa ga Ɓoaze.» <verse eid="RUT 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 2:20"/>Naomi ɠɛni ná-doun anzai ma: «Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI tuya loo naama nui ʋɛ, tɛigi é maawɔinɠai ɠɛɛzu naati bɛ, ti vulua, ta naati bɛ, niiti ti zaai!» Naomi ɠɛni ma mɔnɔ: «Zunui naa ɠa ga da-nu ɠiteɠite, toɠa ga naati ti ta, niiti ti-losuʋɛ ga ti de unmɔɔ.»<verse eid="RUT 2:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 2:21"/>Moaɓe nui Lute ta laani ma, é ɠɛ ma: «Kɛɛʋɛ mà ɓalaa: ‹Yɛ nà-botiɠɛ nuiti ba, eyɛsu ti ɓe ga nà-moloi leʋe.› » <verse eid="RUT 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 2:22"/>Naomi ɠɛni ná-doun anzai Lute ma: «Naa ʋagɛ, dòun anzanu, ga è ɠɛ ná-botiɠɛ anzanuiti ba, naa ɠa a kɛ nu mina è ɓɔlɔ kpalagi taɠili su.»<verse eid="RUT 2:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="RUT 2:23"/>Naazu, é yɛni Ɓoaze ná-botiɠɛ anzanuiti ba, é ɗa posuyɛʋɛi ɠɛ, eyɛsu moloi nii daa ga wɔɔlezegi ta moloi nii daa ga ɓeleegi, naati ti leʋe vaiti kpein ti ɓe. Naa pɛ su é ɠɛɛni deemɔɔn ʋɔ bɛ.<verse eid="RUT 2:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="RUT 3"/>
  <para style="s">Lute ná-maanɛɛnɛi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 3:1"/>Yeeta Lute deemɔɔn Naomi ɠɛni ma: «Dòun anzanu, nà pɔ gè è zei ʋele ɓɛtɛ, naa ɠa a kɛ è ɠɛ undaanɛɛi zu. <verse eid="RUT 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 3:2"/>È kwɛni ga Ɓoaze nii è ɠɛa ná-botiɠɛ anzanuiti ba, naa ɠa ga da-nui ta. Tama za kpɔkɔi, toɠa liizu moloi ɠaavɛɛzu, ná-molo loɠazuʋɛ. <verse eid="RUT 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 3:3"/>Maagba, è gulɔ maku nɛɛnɛgi ziɛ ɓɔɠɔ ma, è ɗa-zeɠe ʋagɔiti too, è yei molo loɠazuʋɛ. Mina ɓɔɠɔ lɛɛ la, eyɛsu é ɓe ga daamii wo, é ɓɔɔle. <verse eid="RUT 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 3:4"/>Siɛgi zu é liizu la, é la, ná ʋɛtɛ, ʋɛ é laazu ná. Naa ʋolu maaɓuɠa ba, è seɠei tago wuzeɠe kɔɠɔiti ma, è la. Tɔ ɓɔɠɔgo, toɠa naa wo è ma, nii maanɛai ga è kɛ.» <verse eid="RUT 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 3:5"/>Lute gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Nà naa kpein kɛ, nii è boga mà.»<verse eid="RUT 3:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 3:6"/>É yeini molo loɠazuʋɛ, é naa kpein kɛɛni, nii deemɔɔn deveni ma. <verse eid="RUT 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 3:7"/>Ɓoaze laamiini, é ɓɔɔle, koozunɛɛni ziimaʋɛ. É liini, é la molo ɠiliiti poluʋɛ. Lute ʋaani naazu vaavaa, é seɠei zeɠe kɔɠɔiti ma, é la. <verse eid="RUT 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 3:8"/>Kua zaamai, zunui naa wuunni kami, é lati, é ka ga anzanui ta ɠa laani kɔɠɔiti bu. <verse eid="RUT 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 3:9"/>É ɠɛ ma: «Ɓɛ ɠa ga ɗe?» Naa gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Nà ʋe, Lute ʋe, ɗa-wotiɠɛ anzanui. Ɓaa màazu, mazɔlɔɔ ʋelei è la ga gi ɓɔɠɔ nu, unmɔɔ fai ma losuʋɛ veeʋɛ è ya nɔ̀un tetema.»<verse eid="RUT 3:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 3:10"/>É ɠɛni ma: «Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI tuya loo è ʋɛ, dòun anzanu! Faa ɠaaɓelagi nii ɠa ɗa-wooɠɛɠiladai lɛɛzu mɔnɔ, é leʋe ma mɔungi ʋa, mazɔlɔɔ è la nu niinɛiti gaiziɛni, bala nua, ɓaa kpɛtɛ nua. <verse eid="RUT 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 3:11"/>Niizu, dòun anzanu, mina lua ɲɛgɛlɛin. Nà naa kpein kɛ è ʋɛ, nii è bosu, mazɔlɔɔ nuɓusɛ pɛ ge suɠwɛɛ ga ɗa ga anzanu zɔɓelama. <verse eid="RUT 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 3:12"/>Gaamai ʋe ga unmɔɔ fai ma losuʋɛ ɠa zèa, kɛlɛ taɠili ka ná, nii é nɔ̀un tuɠɔ. <verse eid="RUT 3:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 3:13"/>Ɲi ʋɛ. Lina, ni toɠa pɔ é unmɔɔ fai ma losuʋɛ ɠɛ è ʋɛ, é kɛ. Kɛlɛ ni é la nɛɛni bɛ ga é kɛ è ʋɛ, gè ɠona Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ma, nii é vulua, nɔ̀un, nà kɛ è ʋɛ. Yɛ laani eyɛsu sobu.»<verse eid="RUT 3:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 3:14"/>É yɛni laani kɔɠɔiti bu eyɛsu sobui. É wuzeɠeni ga kpidiɓidigi, nu la dɛ zooga è ʋa nu maaɓɛɛɠaga ɠa. Mazɔlɔɔ Ɓoaze ɠɛni ma: «Maa la nɛɛni ga nu ʋa suɠwɛɛ ga anzanu lɛɛʋɛ molo loɠazuʋɛ.» <verse eid="RUT 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 3:15"/>É ɠɛni ma: «Ɗa-zeɠe wolai zuvie, è so.» É soni. Naa su lɔzita ɠɔɠɔni moloi zu, é pu su, é daalɛ bu. Naa ʋolu é lɛɛni taazu.<verse eid="RUT 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 3:16"/>Lute ʋaani deemɔɔn ʋɔ bɛ. Naomi ɠɛni ma: «Ɗa ʋe ɓaa, dòun anzanu?» Lute naa kpein suɠulani, nii zunui naa kɛɛni bɛ. <verse eid="RUT 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 3:17"/>É ɠɛni ma: «É su lɔzita veeʋɛ bɛ̀ moloi zu, é ɠɛ mà: ‹È la lia ga yeaɲaka è-leemɔɔn ʋɔ bɛ.› » <verse eid="RUT 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 3:18"/>Naomi ɠɛni ma: «Yɛ ʋɛ, è yiilɛi, dòun anzanu, eyɛsu è kwɛɛ ʋelei niima vai ʋaazu ɓesu da, mazɔlɔɔ zunui nii la dooɠo nɔpɛ boga ɲɛgɛlɛin, kɛni a niima vai ɠaaɓelana za.»<verse eid="RUT 3:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="RUT 4"/>
  <para style="s">Lute vulu vai Ɓoaze ʋɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 4:1"/>Ɓoaze liini taa ziɠidaʋɛ, é zei ná. Pɛtɛ, zɔi unmɔɔ fai ma losuʋɛ ɠɛni zea, nii Ɓoaze ná-fai woni, naa ʋaani, é ɗa leʋe. Ɓoaze ɠɛni ma: «Ʋaa lɛɛ ʋɛ, zei lɛɛ ʋɛ.» Naa ʋaani, é zei. <verse eid="RUT 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 4:2"/>Ɓoaze nu puugɔ zeɠeni taa ɠɛwolaiti saama, é ɠɛni ti ma: «À zei lɛɛ ʋɛ.» Ti zeini. <verse eid="RUT 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 4:3"/>Naa ʋolu é ɠɛni naama nui ma, nii unmɔɔ fai ma losuʋɛ ɠɛni zea: «È suɠwɛɛni ga Naomi ʋa, é zeɠe Moaɓe yooi zu. Toɠa pɔ é zou ɓuɠai ʋɔdi, nii é ga ade-ɠɛɛloin Elimelɛke nɔnɔi. <verse eid="RUT 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 4:4"/>Gè ɠisiɛʋɛ ga gè naa wo è ma, ga è geya taaʋeaiti gaazu, ta nà-nuɓusɛiti ta-ɠɛwolaiti gaazu. Ni ɗa pɔ è unmɔɔ, unmɔɔ. Ni è la unmɔɔsu, dɛɛ ga ze, gè ɠɛ kwɛɛ, mazɔlɔɔ ɗa ɠa mɔunpa ma losuʋɛ è ya. Nà ɠa é zèa ɗɔun è ʋoluma.» É gooɠaaʋoteni, é ɠɛ ma: «Nà pɔ gè zooi unmɔɔ.»<verse eid="RUT 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 4:5"/>Ɓoaze ɠɛni ma: «Foloi è zooi ɠeyazu la Naomi ma, ɗa Moaɓe nui Lute ɓalaagi zei naama ziɛgi zu, nii é ga poanzai, nii a kɛ sinigi nii saai, vofoda ɠɛ naa ʋa, niiti ta ná-poganii zeɠe.» <verse eid="RUT 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 4:6"/>Zɔi unmɔɔ fai ma losuʋɛ ɠɛni zea, naa gooɠaaʋote, é ɠɛ ma: «Ni naa ʋe, gè ɠɛlɛa unmɔɔ tosuʋɛ ʋa, gè mina ʋa nà-poganii ɠoloɠolosu. Unmɔɔ fai ma losuʋɛ zeɠe ga ɗɔnɔ, mazɔlɔɔ gè la zooga gè ʋa unmɔɔ.»<verse eid="RUT 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 4:7"/>Izilayɛle nuiti saama mɔungi, faa nɔpɛ a la ɠɛna ɠilia ba, é lo unmɔɔ faa ʋa, ɓaa anii maavalibo faa ʋa, gilagi ɓena ná-saʋalagi ɠula ɠɔɠɔa, é fe zɔi ya, naa ɓena ɠɛ ga poogi Izilayɛle nuiti bɛ ga naama vai ɓɛtɛa. <verse eid="RUT 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 4:8"/>Zɔi unmɔɔ fai ma losuʋɛ ɠɛni zea, naa ɠɛni Ɓoaze ma: «Zooi ɠeya ɓɔɠɔ ʋɛ,» é ná-saʋalagi ɠulani ɠɔɠɔa.<verse eid="RUT 4:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 4:9"/>Ɓoaze ɠɛni naazu kɛwolaiti ta nuɓusɛiti kpein ma: «Wo ɠɛa ga zeeleiti za, ga nii kpein é ɠɛa ga Elimelɛke nɔnɔ ta Kiliyon, naa ʋɛɛ Maalon ʋa, gè naati pɛ geyaa Naomi ma. <verse eid="RUT 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 4:10"/>Gè Moaɓe nui Lute zeiɗa ɓalaa, é ɠɛ ga ànza, nii é ɠɛni ga Maalon anzai, ga nii saai naa laaseigi mina ɲɛɛlɛ ná-poganii zaama, naa ɠa a kɛ daaseigi yɛ ná ɠɔ kɛɛɠɛleaiti saama, sɔlɔɔ taa ziɠidaʋɛ. Wo ɠɛa ga ma zeeleiti za.»<verse eid="RUT 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 4:11"/>Nuɓusɛi niiti kpein ti ɠɛni taa ziɠidaʋɛ ta kɛwolaiti, ti ɠɛni ma: «Gá ga naama zeeleiti! Anzanui é lɛɛzu ɗa-ʋɛlɛi wu, Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI kɛ ga Zakɔɓe anzaiti Lasɛle ta Leani kɛʋele, niiti ti felegɔiti ti Izilayɛle ʋɛlɛyeɠei logai! Ɗa ɓɔɠɔi ɓalaa, tuyai ɠɛ è ma Efelata, ta è lɔɠɔ zɔlɔɔ Ɓɛteleyɛme! <verse eid="RUT 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 4:12"/>Vofodai nii Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI feezu è ya ga anzanu loungoi nii maaʋele, é ɗa-ʋɛlɛyeɠei ɠɛ ga Pelɛze ná-pɛlɛyeɠei ɠɛʋele, nii Tamaal sɔlɔɔni Zuda ʋɛ!»<verse eid="RUT 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 4:13"/>Ɓoaze Lute zeɠeni, é kɛ ga anza, é daani ʋolu. Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI vaani bu Lute kogi zeɠe, é doun zunu zɔlɔɔ. <verse eid="RUT 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 4:14"/>Anzanuiti ti ɠɛni Naomi ma: «Mamagi ɠa Ɠɔoɠɔ GALAGI ʋɛ, nii é la vaani bu, è ʋa ʋala za pɛlɛyeɠei makɛ nui ma, GALA ge kɛ daaseigi wɔɔlɔ Izilayɛle nuiti saama faan! <verse eid="RUT 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 4:15"/>Doin nii ɠa è-yɛnvui niinɛ, é è makɛ ɗa wɔlɔzaɠana, mazɔlɔɔ è-loun anzai nii è nɛai bɛ, ta fizɔgai è ʋɛ zunu loun lɔfela ʋa, naa ɠa é sɔlɔɔgai.» <verse eid="RUT 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 4:16"/>Naomi doin zeɠeni, é pɛɛ yiila. Tɔ ɠa é kulani su. <verse eid="RUT 4:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 4:17"/>Anzanuiti ti ɠɛni ga seiɲɔɠɔiti, naati ti ɠɛ ma: «Doun zunu zɔlɔɔga Naomi ʋɛ!» Ti daasei pɛɛni ga Woɓɛde. Tɔ ɠa é ɠɛni ga Izayi kɛɛɠɛ, é ɠɛ ga Davide kɛɛɠɛwola.<verse eid="RUT 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Davide mɛmɛwolaiti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 4:18"/>Pelɛze mavofodaiti ta ga: Pelɛze Ɠɛsɛlon zɔlɔɔni, <verse eid="RUT 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 4:19"/>Ɠɛsɛlon Lame zɔlɔɔ, Lame Aminadaɓe zɔlɔɔ, <verse eid="RUT 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 4:20"/>Aminadaɓe Naason zɔlɔɔ, Naason Salema zɔlɔɔ, <verse eid="RUT 4:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 4:21"/>Salema Ɓoaze zɔlɔɔ, Ɓoaze Woɓɛde zɔlɔɔ, <verse eid="RUT 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 4:22"/>Woɓɛde Izayi zɔlɔɔ, ta Izayi Davide zɔlɔɔ.<verse eid="RUT 4:22"/></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 4"/>
</usx>
